<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/20th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">Spanish Civil War</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1936–1939</span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Spanish Civil War was fought between the Second Spanish Republic and the Nationalist rebels led by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/francisco-franco">Francisco Franco</a>, who rose in July 1936. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/germany">Germany</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a> aided the Nationalists and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/soviet-union">Soviet Union</a> the Republic. The Basque autonomous government fell in 1937, and the Nationalist victory in 1939 began Franco's dictatorship.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/spanish-civil-war.jpg" alt="Spanish Civil War" width="320" height="248" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown authorUnknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D0%98%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%8F_11_%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%B3%D0%B0%D0%B4%D0%B0_%D0%B2_%D0%B1%D0%BE%D1%8E_%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B4_%D0%91%D0%B5%D0%BB%D1%8C%D1%87%D0%B8%D1%82%D0%B5._1937-edit.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
